      "content": "hi, i'm studying for my diesel mechanics certification and i'm a bit stuck on turbochargers. can you explain the basic cycle of how the exhaust gas actually turns the turbine and then how that translates to the intake manifold pressure? i want to make sure i have the steps right for the exam. thanks.",
